          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.29,
          "end": 10.72,
          "en": "and description for the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.72,
          "end": 12.58,
          "en": "but also for the other pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.58,
          "end": 14.78,
          "en": "And feel free to do this on your own, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.78,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "with your titles and descriptions of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "I will start here with events index.js, and then here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 26.17,
          "en": "in the fragment, maybe here, at this head component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.17,
          "end": 28.48,
          "en": "And of course, therefore, also imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.48,
          "end": 33.48,
          "en": "So import Head from next/head, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.04,
          "end": 38.02,
          "en": "And then here, since this lists all events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.02,
          "end": 40.9,
          "en": "I will give it a title of All Events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.9,
          "end": 43.27,
          "en": "and I'll keep this description text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.27,
          "end": 46.54,
          "en": "Of course, we could use a different one but I'll keep that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.54,
          "end": 51.43,
          "en": "Copy this again, go to the event ID page for a single event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.43,
          "end": 55.27,
          "en": "And here, I'll then also add this in my fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.27,
          "end": 60.27,
          "en": "and add the import, import Head from next/head, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 65.11,
          "en": "And, with that again, fine tune this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.11,
          "end": 67.32,
          "en": "And here, the title should actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.32,
          "end": 69.603,
          "en": "be the title of the selected event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.53,
          "en": "Now, the great thing is since we used that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "in our regular page component JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 82.09,
          "en": "we can, of course, also inject dynamic content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.09,
          "end": 84.47,
          "en": "So, instead of hard coding the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.47,
          "end": 86.87,
          "en": "we can use event.title here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.87,
          "end": 89.74,
          "en": "to use the title of the selected event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.74,
          "end": 91.75,
          "en": "This is, of course, very important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.75,
          "end": 94.3,
          "en": "because this ensures that we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.3,
          "end": 97.87,
          "en": "to hard code all that head data in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.87,
          "end": 102.82,
          "en": "but that since we added to the regular component JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.82,
          "end": 107.75,
          "en": "that we can, of course, also use a lot of dynamic values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.75,
          "end": 110.25,
          "en": "for the content, so for the description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.25,
          "end": 113.983,
          "en": "we could therefore, for example, also use event.description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.22,
          "end": 117.65299999999999,
          "en": "So, that is very, very useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.64,
          "end": 121.19,
          "en": "And with that, if I go to the slug here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.19,
          "end": 126.19,
          "en": "I also want to add this, add it down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 127.54,
          "end": 130.52,
          "en": "And therefore also import this from next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.52,
          "end": 135.52,
          "en": "So, import Head from next/head, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 136.91,
          "end": 141.41,
          "en": "And also, set a title, and a description here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 141.41,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "So, here I'll say filtered Events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "And then here we could, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.8,
          "en": "again use a dynamic value for the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 149.8,
          "end": 152.96,
          "en": "and kind of construct a dynamic text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 152.96,
          "end": 156.77,
          "en": "where we say All events for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.77,
          "end": 158.8,
          "en": "and then I want to use the actual month,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 158.8,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "and year that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 166.07,
          "en": "So, I'll just output for numMonth/numYear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 169.68,
          "end": 171.92000000000002,
          "en": "And, of course, you can fine tune this text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 171.92000000000002,
          "end": 175.07,
          "en": "and format this date however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 175.07,
          "end": 178.76,
          "en": "But, with that, if we save all those different page files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.76,
          "end": 180.83,
          "en": "if I go to all events, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.83,
          "end": 183.62,
          "en": "and I search for events in May,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.62,
          "end": 187.32,
          "en": "we see that if I inspect the rendered page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 187.32,
          "end": 190.48,
          "en": "in the head section we have that title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.48,
          "end": 194.234,
          "en": "and we have that description with that content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 194.234,
          "end": 196.513,
          "en": "that contains the month and year.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 197.7,
          "end": 200.37,
          "en": "Now, it's also worth noting that we don't just see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 200.37,
          "end": 203.52,
          "en": "this head content in the actual rendered page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.52,
          "end": 205.57999999999998,
          "en": "which we see here when we inspect it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.26,
          "en": "but also in the response from the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.26,
          "end": 210.65,
          "en": "If we go back to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.65,
          "end": 214.74,
          "en": "if we reload this page and we then view the page source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.74,
          "end": 218.57999999999998,
          "en": "so that we now fetched a brand new page from the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 220.99,
          "en": "we also find the title in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.99,
          "end": 223.62,
          "en": "and we also find the description in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.62,
          "end": 227.43,
          "en": "So, that is really part of the response, which is important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.43,
          "end": 230.433,
          "en": "because that means that search engines will see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 231.65,
          "end": 235.14,
          "en": "Now you might notice, though, that if you filter for events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.14,
          "end": 238.46,
          "en": "if we set a filter here and we find our events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 238.46,
          "end": 242.25,
          "en": "here, if we reload this page in the page source",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.25,
          "end": 245.97,
          "en": "we don't see the title and the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 245.97,
          "end": 249.35,
          "en": "and that's not a (indistinct) but it has a simple reason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.35,
          "end": 254.07,
          "en": "In our slug page, here, we do add a head,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.07,
          "end": 258.11,
          "en": "but we only add it here in the main content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 258.11,
          "end": 261.08,
          "en": "which we return if we make it past all these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.08,
          "end": 263.36,
          "en": "if checks we have in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.36,
          "end": 266.26,
          "en": "Now, if we make it into one of those if checks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 266.26,
          "end": 270.09,
          "en": "to show the loading text, or to show this error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 270.09,
          "end": 275.09000000000003,
          "en": "or to show another error, then we didn't add head here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 275.34000000000003,
          "end": 277.72,
          "en": "And, of course, we can add head here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 277.72,
          "end": 280.65,
          "en": "And we probably would want to add head here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 285.18,
          "en": "to set specific different titles for these cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.18,
          "end": 287.33,
          "en": "But you also might want to set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 287.33,
          "end": 292.33,
          "en": "some general head content, which is part of every page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 292.58,
          "end": 293.97,
          "en": "And, of course, you can do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 293.97,
          "end": 296.05,
          "en": "by including it in every page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 296.05,
          "end": 299.31,
          "en": "but that involves a lot of copy and pasting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 299.31,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "And therefore, let's now have a look at the different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 307.43,
          "en": "and tools Next.js gives us for reusing logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 307.43,
          "end": 311.9,
          "en": "or reusing configuration, like certain head elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.9,
          "end": 315.883,
          "en": "across all pages without having to copy them around.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
